    {
      "chord_quality": "dom7b9",
      "function_role": "ascending-chromatic-illusion-over-diminished",
      "narrative": "Benson prescribes ascending-only chromatic approach notes when building the chromatic illusion over diminished arpeggios: 'Most often we will only use simple ascending chromatic approaches over the diminished arpeggios. Descending chromatic approaches work differently and we will cover them next' (Chapter 3, p. 260).",
