      "chord_quality": "min-maj7",
      "function_role": "guide-chord-anchor-for-harmonic-minor-zones",
      "narrative": "Benson anchors the entire five-zone harmonic minor fretboard system to two guide chord shapes, the first of which is Cm(maj7): 'Guide Chords => Harmonic Minor & Ionian (#5) = Cm(maj7) & Ebmaj7(#5). 1st Zone: Cm(maj7), 2nd Zone: Eb+(maj7), 3rd Zone: Cm(maj7)...' (Chapter 3, p. 238).",
