      "function_role": "harmonic-minor-forbidden-over-iim7-in-major-cadence",
      "narrative": "Benson explicitly prohibits applying harmonic minor lines to the IIm7 chord in a full major cadence: 'when we have a complete C major cadence such as Dm7 / G7 / Cmaj7, we cannot use C harmonic minor ideas over the Dm7, it would not work' (Chapter 3, p. 236).",
