      "narrative": "Benson maps the three augmented rotations derivable from C harmonic minor to their G7 functions: 'G+: G, B, D# -- (Root, major 3rd, augmented 5th of G); B+: B, D#, G -- (major 3rd, augmented 5th, Root of G); D#+: Eb, G, B -- (minor 6th, Root, major 3rd of G)' (Chapter 3, p. 281).",
